join Charity (Neutral) left
join Hope (Neutral) right
update Charity (Warm)
Charity: This is good. This is better than good — the Nkosi boy's morning is worth three paragraphs of mine.
- What happens now?
	Hope: What happens now?
	Charity: Now I write it properly, send it to Unity Water Foundation, and we wait. Months, most likely.
	Charity: That is the process, not them. Most organisations you write to never answer at all. Unity Water answer, and they answer sooner than they need to.
	Charity: I'd rather tell you that plainly now than have you asking me hopefully every week.
	Charity: You'll ask hopefully every week regardless. Everyone does.
[signal arg="hearts:charity:2"]
set {GameState.quest_charity_roller_case_main} = "complete"
set {GameState.roller_petition_submitted} = true
